203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 142 0 R
/T (The most interesting parts were the actual history of polio. Bottom line - it's a new disease. And we now know that it's definitively linked not \(just\) to the polio virus. Instead, it's toxicity from heavy metals poisoning, substances such as lead arsenic that were just starting to be used as pesticides. They were used as pesticides specifically against species of moths \(thus the Moth in the title\). The consumption of this lead arsenic pesticides \(also mercury and other toxins, common in medications of the time\) caused leaky gut. And that was a necessary condition for the polio virus \(and other viruses, the polio virus was just one of many\) to migrate to the backbone and actually cause paralysis. Otherwise it would just cause a few days of diarrhea.)
/E (The most interesting parts were the actual history of polio. Bottom line - it's a new disease. And we now know that it's definitively linked not \(just\) to the polio virus. Instead, it's toxicity from heavy metals poisoning, substances such as lead arsenic that were just starting to be used as pesticides. They were used as pesticides specifically against species of moths \(thus the Moth in the title\). The consumption of this lead arsenic pesticides \(also mercury and other toxins, common in medications of the time\) caused leaky gut. And that was a necessary condition for the polio virus \(and other viruses, the polio virus was just one of many\) to migrate to the backbone and actually cause paralysis. Otherwise it would just cause a few days of diarrhea.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
