/T (Bottom line, after you read this book you'll understand how what we're told about the vaccine eliminating polio is just not true. There are actually some horrific stories of the first polio vaccines that came out, which actually caused polio outbreaks. When I think about what a sucker I used to be for all the pro-vaccine propaganda, and how I thought that people that didn't vaccinate were at best idiots and worst evil - I realize how powerful propaganda can be.)
/E (Bottom line, after you read this book you'll understand how what we're told about the vaccine eliminating polio is just not true. There are actually some horrific stories of the first polio vaccines that came out, which actually caused polio outbreaks. When I think about what a sucker I used to be for all the pro-vaccine propaganda, and how I thought that people that didn't vaccinate were at best idiots and worst evil - I realize how powerful propaganda can be.)
