/P 147 0 R
/E (I've been fascinated by Jon Conway's Game of Life for years. There are more rabbit holes within these rules than are possible to explore in this post. Suffice to say, if you're not familiar with Conway's Game of Life or cellular automaton, go check that out now.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
